= A #emph[heading]; with #raw("code"); <ntropy-h-1>

Prose with #strong[strong];, #emph[emph];, #strike[strike];, an autolink #link("https://example.com")[https\:\/\/example\.com];, an email #link("mailto:a@b.org")[a\@b\.org];, and a #link("resolved-title.pdf")[#notelink[Resolved Title]]; plus an #link("https://ext")[external];\.

A footnote reference\.#[#footnote[Footnote body with #emph[emphasis]; and a second line\.]<ntropy-fn-1>]; And a dangling display #emph[text];\.

